Haggling at a market in Spanish? Say this 🛍️
In markets across Latin America, a little bargaining is normal.

Today's phrases:
• ¿cuánto cuesta? = how much does it cost?
• es muy caro = it's very expensive
• ¿me hace un descuento? = can you give me a discount?

